  _dev\loop-engineering\phases-plans\implementation-plan.md:670:keeps execution fast and disk usage bounded.
  _dev\loop-engineering\phases-plans\implementation-plan.md:671:
  _dev\loop-engineering\phases-plans\implementation-plan.md:672:### 9.1 Parallel branch execution
  _dev\loop-engineering\phases-plans\implementation-plan.md:673:The scheduler runs independent DAG branches 
concurrently under a bounded worker pool while
  _dev\loop-engineering\phases-plans\implementation-plan.md:674:keeping SSE event ordering deterministic per node and 
the run-level record consistent.
  _dev\loop-engineering\phases-plans\implementation-plan.md:675:Per-node concurrency opt-out for adapters that are not 
thread-safe (Kokoro singleton et al.).
  _dev\loop-engineering\phases-plans\implementation-plan.md:676:**Done when:** a diamond workflow executes both 
branches concurrently (measured overlap in pytest), results and event streams are deterministic, and opted-out 
adapters never overlap.
